# FormSubmit endpoint hash for the contact form.
#
# The form posts to https://formsubmit.co/ajax/<id>. Until this is set the site
# falls back to the raw inbox address, which puts it in the client bundle where
# scrapers can harvest it. To activate:
#   1. Submit the form once — FormSubmit emails a confirmation link to the inbox.
#   2. After confirming, FormSubmit shows the hashed endpoint id for the address.
#   3. Put that hash here (and as a GitHub secret used by the deploy workflow).
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_FORM_ID=
